      <p class="splash-overline" id="splash-overline"><span class="splash-init-label">INITIALIZING</span><span class="splash-init-separator"> · </span><span>THE UNIVERSE WITHIN</span></p><div class="splash-init-track" id="splash-init-track" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
